                                                                        973,
                                                                        1794
                                                                     ]
                                                                  ],
                                                                  "resource_id": null,
                                                                  "checked": false,
                                                                  "text": "I still live near the same beach where I rebuilt my life, and my car is covered in sand, dog hair, kids' toys, and sunscreen \u2014 just as I had always hoped.",
